# Superpowers Bootstrap

You have superpowers.

**IMPORTANT: The `using-superpowers` skill content is already loaded. Do not read it again -- it is the authoritative source for how to invoke and follow skills.**

## Skills Directory

Skills live at `.agents/skills/` (a symlink at `.agents` in the project root).

